2. Hugging Face Hub metadata
----------------------------

Source: https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/api

db.json also contains facts read from the public Hugging Face Hub API and
from anonymous HEAD requests: repository ids, file names, sizes, sha256
hashes, license identifiers, gating, tags, download counts and the times the
URLs were checked. No model weights, model cards or other content of the
repositories are included or redistributed.

The license field of each model only REPORTS the license that its publisher
declared (traced to the upstream where possible). genmodelfit does not grant
any right to use a model. Check each model's own license before you download
or use it.

Hugging Face Hub の公開 API と匿名の HEAD で読んだ事実(ID・ファイル名・大きさ・
sha256・ライセンスの名前・申請の要否・ダウンロード数など)を含みます。モデル本体や
モデルカードは含みません。ライセンスは表示するだけで、利用を許諾するものではありません。


3. llmfit
---------

Source: https://github.com/AlexsJones/llmfit

genmodelfit is inspired by llmfit (which does the same for LLMs): the idea of
fit levels by memory utilization, the selection rules for Hugging Face models
and the command layout. No code or data from llmfit is copied into genmodelfit.
genmodelfit is not an official llmfit project or fork.

llmfit に着想を得ています(段階の考え方・HF のモデルの選び方・コマンドの形)。
llmfit のコードやデータは写していません。llmfit の公式の派生ではありません。
